# 3. `clear()`

Use when an input already contains text and you want to remove it.

```java
WebElement username =
        driver.findElement(By.id("username"));

username.clear();

username.sendKeys("Jaswanth");
```

Think:

```text
Existing:
John

clear()
  ↓

Empty

sendKeys("Jaswanth")
  ↓

Jaswanth
```

